 * {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|life_stealer_open_wounds}} has two main components:
** Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|bonus ls}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*** The [[lifesteal]] component considers the following damage instances sourced to the caster's allies:
**** All {{Symbol|Damage|Magical}} {{Symbol|Damage|Physical}} {{Symbol|Damage|Pure}} [[damage type]]s.
**** From both {{M|attack damage}} and {{M|spell damage}}.
**** {{Symbol|Kill|Instant}}
***** [[Instant kill]] sources on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy applies a lifesteal-based heal corresponding to the affected unit's {{M|current health}}.
*** Stacks additively with other lifesteal sources.
*** Does not interact with the following damage instance sources:
**** {{M|HP Removal}} sources, except for {{A|Viper|Corrosive Skin}} and {{A|Warlock|Fatal Bonds}}.
**** Self-damage sources applied by the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy itself.
**** From the affected enemy's allied units.
**** {{M|Buildings}}
**** {{M|Neutral creeps}}.
**** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|bonus t2l}}
*** {{cf|talnotes}} Grants flat bonus {{M|attack speed}} to allied units upon their [[attack point]] on the debuff-affected enemy unit.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-3.png|3|21px]] {{Symbol|a|Down}} {{Symbol|Movement Speed}}
*** Applies {{#var:Open Wounds type1 value1}} [[movement speed]] slow ({{Code|S<sub>n</sub>}}) instances, starting immediately upon debuff application, in 1-second intervals over the duration as follows:
**** {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} 
***** The movement speed slow starts from its max value, up to the {{#var:Open Wounds type1 value2}}<sup>nd</sup> instance.
**** {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} 
***** The next {{#expr:{{#var:Open Wounds type1 value1}}-{{#var:Open Wounds type1 value2}}-{{#var:Open Wounds type1 value3}}}} instances reduces the movement speed slow linearly per step.
**** {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} 
***** Applies the min movement speed slow value starting from the {{#expr:{{#var:Open Wounds type1 value2}}+{{#var:Open Wounds type1 value3}}+1}}<sup>th</sup> instance onward, with full restoration to the debuff-affected unit's movement speed only at the end of the duration.
*** {{cf|expr}}
**** Min movement speed slow: {{Code|MAX(S) / 5}}
**** First two slow interval's value: {{Code|S<sub>1</sub> {{=}} S<sub>2</sub> {{=}} MAX(S)}}
**** Subsequent slow interval's value: {{Code|S<sub>n</sub> {{=}} MAX(S) - ( MIN(S) × (n - 2) ) , when 3 < n < 5 }}
**** Final three slow interval's value: {{Code|S<sub>6</sub> {{=}} S<sub>7</sub> {{=}} S<sub>8</sub> {{=}} MIN(S)}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Open Wounds icon0}}
| desc = Lifestealer rends an enemy unit, slowing the victim's movement speed and allowing all allies to regain health for a percentage of the damage they deal to that unit. The victim recovers movement speed over the duration.
}}

